---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../consts';

const lastUpdated = 'May 3, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${BRAND.name}`}
  description={`Privacy policy for ${BRAND.legalName} — how we collect, use, and protect your information when you contact us or use our website.`}
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-navy-300 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-gold-400">Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        {BRAND.legalName} — last updated {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-headings:font-serif prose-headings:text-navy-900 prose-a:text-gold-600 max-w-none text-gray-600">

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy describes how {BRAND.legalName} ("we," "us," or "our"), operated by Enrique Gandara, collects, uses, and protects information you provide when you visit {BRAND.domain} or contact us to schedule an insurance review. We are committed to protecting your privacy and handling your information with care.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information only when you voluntarily provide it to us. This includes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact form submissions</strong> — your first and last name, email address, phone number, and the topic or message you submit through the contact form on our website.</li>
          <li><strong>Direct communications</strong> — information you share when you call, email, or message us directly to inquire about our services.</li>
          <li><strong>Scheduling information</strong> — details you provide when booking a coverage check or coverage review appointment.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Apart from the analytics cookies described under Third-Party Services below, we do not use cookies for tracking, do not operate any user accounts or login systems, and do not automatically collect personal information beyond standard web server logs (IP address, browser type, referring page) that your browser sends to any website you visit.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Information you share with us is used solely to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiry or question</li>
          <li>Schedule and confirm coverage review appointments</li>
          <li>Follow up on matters you have raised with us</li>
          <li>Fulfill our obligations as your insurance advisor if you become a client</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not use your information for marketing to unrelated third parties, automated profiling, or any purpose beyond delivering the advisory service you contacted us about.
        </p>

        <h2>We Do Not Sell Your Information</h2>
        <p>
          {BRAND.name} does not sell, rent, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to any third party for their independent use. Your contact information is not shared with insurance carriers, lead brokers, or any other commercial entity without your explicit consent.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our website uses a limited number of third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Web hosting (Cloudflare Pages)</strong> — Our site is hosted on Cloudflare, which may log standard access data (IP addresses, request timestamps) for security and performance purposes. Cloudflare has its own privacy policy governing that data.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Fonts</strong> — We load web fonts from Google Fonts, which may log your IP address when your browser fetches the font files. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics</strong> — We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how visitors find and move through the site in aggregate. It collects standard measurement data such as pages viewed, approximate location, device type, and referring site. We do not use it to identify individual visitors, and we do not run advertising, remarketing, or behavioral retargeting on this website. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a> for details.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Contact form processing</strong> — Form submissions are received by a serverless function running on Cloudflare and delivered by email to our team inbox through Resend, a third-party email delivery provider. Submissions are not stored in a database. Transmission is encrypted, and the contents are accessible only to us.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Beyond the aggregate analytics described above, we do not use Facebook Pixel, advertising pixels, or any behavioral retargeting tools on this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We take reasonable precautions to protect your information. Our website uses HTTPS encryption for all data transmitted between your browser and our server. Contact form submissions are transmitted securely and stored in access-controlled systems. We do not store financial account numbers, Social Security numbers, or sensitive personal identifiers through this website.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain contact information and correspondence for as long as reasonably necessary to fulfill the purpose for which it was collected — typically the duration of any client relationship plus any period required by applicable law or professional licensing obligations. Inquiries that do not result in a client engagement are retained for a reasonable period and then deleted.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Our website is not directed at children under 13 years of age, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has submitted information to us, please contact us and we will promptly delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your information, subject to any legal retention requirements</li>
          <li>Opt out of any future communications from us</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Tennessee residents may have additional rights under applicable state privacy law. We will honor valid requests to access, correct, or delete your data.
        </p>

        <h2>External Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their policies before providing any personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "last updated" date at the top of this page. Material changes will be noted prominently. Your continued use of our website after any update constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions, concerns, or requests related to this Privacy Policy or your personal information, please contact us:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Business:</strong> {BRAND.legalName}</li>
          <li><strong>Advisor:</strong> Enrique Gandara</li>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${BRAND.email}`}>{BRAND.email}</a></li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href={`tel:${BRAND.phoneE164}`}>{BRAND.phone}</a></li>
          <li><strong>Service area:</strong> Nashville Metro Area, Tennessee</li>
        </ul>

      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="mt-14 p-8 bg-navy-900 rounded-2xl text-white text-center">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-semibold mb-3">Questions about your coverage?</h2>
        <p class="text-navy-200 mb-6 text-sm">Schedule a coverage review — no pressure, no sales pitch.</p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-900 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors"
        >
          Book a Coverage Check
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
